  id: washer_line_carryover
  displayName: Washer Line Carryover
  explanation: Cleaner surfactant entering the quench tank from the wash stage. Demulsibility
    collapses, water climbs, and the quench curve is disturbed. THE OIL IS NOT THE
    FAULT. Replace the charge without fixing the washer and the next sample looks
    exactly the same.
